cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Se usar este corpus, cite-o como indicado abaixo."
type: dataset
title: "Corpus de Orquestração Multi-IA: diálogos de um pesquisador com ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude e Perplexity (2025–2026)"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-23"
license: CC-BY-4.0
authors:
  - family-names: "Alencastro Curado Filho"
    given-names: "André"
repository-code: "https://github.com/andrealencastro/corpus-orquestracao-multi-ia"
url: "https://github.com/andrealencastro/corpus-orquestracao-multi-ia"
abstract: >-
  Naturalistic corpus of 25 working documents (about 2.44 million words and
  2,432 speaker turns) in which a single researcher orchestrates several large
  language models (OpenAI ChatGPT, Google Gemini, Anthropic Claude and
  Perplexity) within the same sessions for academic research, prompt
  engineering and deep-research planning, recorded between 2025 and 2026.
  Mostly Portuguese, with English and French. Personal data were masked or
  removed before release. Includes per-document and per-turn metadata (CSV),
  a datasheet, a codebook and a reproducible extraction script.
keywords:
  - interação humano-IA
  - human-AI interaction
  - large language models
  - multi-LLM orchestration
  - prompt engineering
  - deep research
  - corpus
  - Portuguese
  - ChatGPT
  - Gemini
  - Claude
  - Perplexity
